  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3760,
      "text": "Indeed, on that Day the people of Paradise will be busy enjoying themselves,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 444,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3761,
      "text": "they and their spouses will be reclining on couches in the shade.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 444,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3762,
      "text": "They will have therein fruits and all what they ask for[16].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 57,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 444,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3763,
      "text": "“Peace”: a word from a Most Merciful Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 58,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 444,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3764,
      "text": "“Stand apart [from the believers] this Day, O wicked ones!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 59,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 444,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3765,
      "text": "Did I not command you, O children of Adam, not to worship Satan, for he is your sworn enemy,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 444,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3766,
      "text": "but to worship Me? This is a straight path.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 61,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 444,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3767,
      "text": "He had already misled great multitudes of you. Did you not then have sense?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 62,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 444,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3768,
      "text": "This is the Hell that you were promised.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 63,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 444,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3769,
      "text": "Burn in it Today for your disbelief[17].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 64,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 444,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3770,
      "text": "Today We will seal up their mouths, and their hands will speak to Us, and their feet will testify to all what they used to do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 65,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 444,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3771,
      "text": "If We willed, We could have taken away their sight, so they would rush to find their way, but then how could they see?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 66,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 444,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3772,
      "text": "And if We willed, We could have paralyzed them in their places[18], so they could neither move forward nor backward.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 444,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3773,
      "text": "Whomsoever We give a long life, We cause his strength to decline[19]. Do they not then understand?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 68,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 444,
      "ruku": 385,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3774,
      "text": "We have not taught him poetry, nor is it fitting for him. This is only a Reminder and a clear Qur’an",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 69,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 444,
      "ruku": 385,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3775,
      "text": "so that he may warn those who are truly alive[20] and establish the argument against the disbelievers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 70,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
